<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Controlled Substances Discrepancy Form</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .logo-area {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .logo {
    width: 80px;
    height: auto;
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
  .title-area {
    text-align: right;
  }
  .title-area h1 {
    font-size: 18pt;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .title-area h2 {
    font-size: 14pt;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .section {
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }
  .form-group {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .form-group label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .form-group input[type="text"], .form-group textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 5px;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: inherit;
  }
  .checkbox-group label {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 20px;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .signature-line {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
  .signature-box {
    width: 45%;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .signature-box div {
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
    margin-top: 5px;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding: 10px;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .disclaimer {
    font-size: 9pt;
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-row">
    <div class="logo-area">
      <!-- Placeholder for University Logo -->
      <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="University Logo" class="logo">
      <div>
        <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span><br>
        <span data-field="office_name">{{ office_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="title-area">
      <h1>CONTROLLED SUBSTANCES</h1>
      <h2>DISCREPANCY FORM</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p><strong>Instructions:</strong> This form should be completed if a discrepancy in the amount of controlled substances is discovered. See page 2 for CHECKLIST OF STEPS TO BE TAKEN IN CASEOF SUSPECTED LOSS OR THEFT OF CONTROLLED SUBSTANCES.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Name of Registrant:</label>
      <span data-field="registrant_name">{{ registrant_name }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Type of Discrepancy: Include discrepancies noted that are potentially indicative of significant loss or theft of controlled substances.</label>
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox"> Significant Loss of Controlled Substances</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> Theft of Controlled Substances</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Date of Discovery:</label>
      <span data-field="date_of_discovery">{{ date_of_discovery }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Time of Discovery:</label>
      <span data-field="time_of_discovery">{{ time_of_discovery }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Location Where Discrepancy was Discovered:</label>
      <span data-field="location_of_discovery">{{ location_of_discovery }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Name/Phone Number/Email Address of Person who Made Discovery:</label>
      <span data-field="discoverer_contact_info">{{ discoverer_contact_info }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Name(s), Schedule(s) and Form(s) of Controlled Substances Involved:</label>
      <span data-field="substances_involved">{{ substances_involved }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Description of Circumstances of Discrepancy (e.g., evidence of attempted break-in, broken safety tab on container, evidence of missing containers or substances, discrepancy in inventory/audit):</label>
      <textarea data-field="description_of_circumstances">{{ description_of_circumstances }}</textarea>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Names/Titles of Any Person Involved in Discrepancy and/or Discovery or Reporting of Discrepancy:</label>
      <span data-field="involved_persons">{{ involved_persons }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Names/Title of Person Completing this Report:</label>
      <span data-field="reporter_name_title">{{ reporter_name_title }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="signature-line">
      <div class="signature-box">
        <label>Signature:</label>
        <div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="signature-box">
        <label>Date:</label>
        <div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="disclaimer">
      <p><strong>Fax or email copies of this form to the following units:</strong></p>
      <p>The University of Toledo IACUC Office</p>
      <p>Office: <span data-field="iacuc_phone">{{ iacuc_phone }}</span> | Email: <span data-field="iacuc_email">{{ iacuc_email }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-row">
    <div class="logo-area">
      <!-- Placeholder for University Logo -->
      <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="University Logo" class="logo">
      <div>
        <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span><br>
        <span data-field="office_name">{{ office_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="title-area">
      <h1>CONTROLLED SUBSTANCES</h1>
      <h2>DISCREPANCY FORM</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h3>CHECKLIST OF STEPS TO BE TAKEN IN CASES OF SUSPECTED LOSS OR THEFT OF CONTROLLED SUBSTANCES</h3>

    <ol>
      <li>If a registrant has a reasonable belief or suspicion that there has been (a) theft of any amount of a controlled substance; or (b) significant loss of a Controlled Substance, the event must be promptly reported to the following units:
        <ul>
          <li>University of Toledo IACUC Office</li>
          <li>University of Toledo Police Department (UTPD)</li>
          <li>U.S. Drug Enforcement Agency (DEA)</li>
          <li>Ohio Board of Pharmacy (OBP)</li>
        </ul>
        If there is doubt about whether a report should be made, err on the side of reporting.
      </li>
      <li>To determine if a loss is "significant," the registrant should consider the following factors:
        <ol type="a">
          <li>The actual quantity of controlled substance lost in relation to the type of activities performed by registrant.</li>
          <li>The specific controlled substance that was lost and whether it is a likely candidate for diversion.</li>
          <li>Whether the loss can be associated with access to the controlled substances by specific individuals.</li>
          <li>Whether the loss can be attributed to unique activities that take place involving the controlled substances.</li>
          <li>Whether there has been a pattern of losses of a specific period or alternatively, whether the loss appears to be random.</li>
          <li>The results of any efforts to resolve the loss.</li>
          <li>Any local trends or other indicators that the lost controlled substance has been diverted.</li>
        </ol>
        Registrants with questions about how to apply the foregoing factors in determining if a loss is significant can contact IACUC for advice.
      </li>
      <li>The contacts, correct forms and timetable for reporting are listed below:
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Unit Receiving Report</th>
              <th>Contact Information</th>
              <th>Timetable</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>DEA</td>
              <td>Complete and submit DEA Form 106 on-line at <a href="http://www.dea.gov/forms/form106.pdf">http://www.dea.gov/forms/form106.pdf</a>.</td>
              <td>Within one business day of discovery of theft or significant loss</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>OBP</td>
              <td>Contact IACUC Office at <span data-field="obp_phone">{{ obp_phone }}</span> for discovery of theft assistance in completing DEA Form 106.</td>
              <td>Within 48 hours of discovery</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>UTPD</td>
              <td><span data-field="utpd_contact">{{ utpd_contact }}</span></td>
              <td>Promptly upon discovery.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>IACUC Office</td>
              <td>Complete and submit Controlled Substances Discrepancy Report and email to IACUC@UToledo.edu.</td>
              <td>Promptly upon discovery.</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="disclaimer">
    <p>Revised <span data-field="revision_date">{{ revision_date }}</span> | Research Compliance Department</p>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>